                <invention-title lang="de">ELEKTRONISCHE VORRICHTUNG ZUR OBJEKTERKENNUNG IN EINEM BILD UND BETRIEBSVERFAHREN DAFÜR</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">DISPOSITIF ÉLECTRONIQUE DE RECONNAISSANCE D'OBJET DANS UNE IMAGE ET SON PROCÉDÉ DE FONCTIONNEMENT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">ELECTRONIC DEVICE FOR RECOGNIZING OBJECT IN IMAGE, AND OPERATION METHOD THEREOF</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Provided is a method, performed by an electronic device, for recognizing a user, the method comprising: receiving a voice utterance of a first user (901) for calling the electronic device (904); determining a first location (902) of the first user (901) based on the voice utterance; capturing a first image of the first user (901) based on the determined location; and based on image information corresponding to the captured first image, identifying the first user (901) as one among preregistered users.</p>
            </abstract>
